  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PACER Plus Implementation Package</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment - the PACER Plus Implementation Package (PPIP) - seeks to address the distinct challenges faced by Pacific Island Countries (PICs) including small and dispersed populations that are constrained in their participation in international trade.
The PPIP will support the establishment of a PACER Plus Implementation Unit (IU) &#x201c;&#x2026; to assist the Joint Committee and the Participants to implement the Agreement&#x201d;.
Following PACER Plus entering into force, the IU will manage a five-year (minimum) work program - the PACER Plus Development and Economic Cooperation Work Program - focused on provision of priority, demand-driven trade related technical assistance (TRTA) aligned with PACER Plus implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
